{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S07、S12、S14把“互相依靠”“让对方安心”“不后悔”等心理说得比Y更确定，削弱了人物原本的犹疑和不确定性。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用关键词加亮、话与感受交替、感受按乐句出现的方式，让观众更容易在听音乐时抓住每段主线，同时不必一次处理所有感受信息。水面、摇荡等反复出现的意象也增强了前后连贯性，音乐细节和身体感受比Y更具体。不过Y在人物动机的解释上更克制，部分心理转折的因果关系交代得更稳，没有X那么容易替人物把尚未确定的心思说满。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "68f9ffda-680c-4f11-80b0-e1c097900289", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T011004908672Z", "elapsed_seconds": 88.328, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:11:33.241061+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "18c2d4a04f7e64ec9c67424cf64c7dac0caae0c825b9433ec7d6a5e3e754aeb1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "ee